flowchart TD
    Start([Start: Receive Task]) --> Init[Initialize Agent<br/>Load model checkpoint]
    Init --> CreateEnv[Create Environment<br/>Launch browser]
    CreateEnv --> GetState[Get Initial State<br/>URL, DOM, accessibility tree]
    
    GetState --> Observe[Encode Observation<br/>StateEncoder]
    Observe --> Predict[Model Prediction<br/>action_type, target, value]
    
    Predict --> ValidAction{Valid Action?}
    ValidAction -->|No| Fallback[Use fallback<br/>SimpleAgent]
    ValidAction -->|Yes| Execute[Execute Action<br/>click, type, scroll, etc.]
    
    Fallback --> Execute
    Execute --> UpdateState[Update Environment State]
    
    UpdateState --> CheckDone{Task Complete?}
    CheckDone -->|No| Record[Record Transition<br/>TrajectoryRecorder]
    CheckDone -->|Yes| Success[Task Success]
    
    Record --> MaxSteps{Max Steps?}
    MaxSteps -->|No| GetState
    MaxSteps -->|Yes| Timeout[Task Timeout]
    
    Success --> SaveTrajectory[Save Full Trajectory<br/>JSON format]
    Timeout --> SaveTrajectory
    
    SaveTrajectory --> Cleanup[Cleanup Resources<br/>Close browser]
    Cleanup --> End([End])
    
    style Start fill:#99ff99
    style End fill:#ff9999
    style Predict fill:#ffcc99
    style Execute fill:#99ccff
    style Success fill:#99ff99
    style Timeout fill:#ff9999
